[Music]  it can't be easy to keep secrets for a  movie as big  and exciting as avengers 4 but these  actors probably could have tried a  little harder  these are a few of the biggest slip ups  by the leading lights of the mcu  a tiny detail there's been plenty of  speculation that the quantum realm will  come into play in a major way in  avengers 4 and it looks like tom holland  may have confirmed that this is the case  speaking with benedict cumberbatch in a  video released by emergency awesome  holland referenced the quantum realm  specifically when comparing his dialogue  in avengers 4 to cumberbatches  he has to talk about so much quantum  realm  stuff just i just have to talk about  yeah man  that's awesome this is cool unless the  dialogue holland is referring to is  along the lines of  gee i'm relieved we don't have to deal  with any of that dumb quantum realm  stuff  then it's a safe bet the strange place  scott lang is trapped in is going to  hold some importance in the final battle  against thanos  long live the queen while promoting  mission impossible fallout  angela bassett who played t'challa's  mother ramonda in black panther  revealed the screen rant that ramona and  shuri survived thanos's purge at the end  of avengers infinity war  when asked if her character was killed  bassett replied no neither did my  daughter  surely she's a bright girl there in  wakanda the fact that both characters  survived could have a serious impact on  the story of avengers 4  and beyond on the one hand with t'challa  dead  the survival of shuri and ramonda may  help determine who takes the throne on  the other  when last we saw shuri she was trying to  separate the mind stone from vision  without killing him  she didn't succeed but she still might  have gained valuable knowledge which our  heroes could use in the coming battle  against thanos  the women of marvel in an interview with  paper magazine  palm clementife who plays mantis in the  guardians films and  infinity war was asked about the me too  movement and her response may have  unintentionally revealed a team-up  between mantis  captain marvel and okoye she recalled i  remember brie larson coming to me and  deny guerrera on the set of the avengers  she told me about the time's up letter  to sign and i found it really amazing to  have all these women and men too  together and fighting for a better world  mantis may have been one of the victims  of thanos purge at the end of avengers  infinity war but clementif's words would  imply that her death won't be entirely  permanent  and if we're getting a team up between  those three it begs the question of just  where it's happening  have mantis and captain marvel made  their way to earth or is okoye somehow  traveling the stars  reunited since avengers 4 promises to be  robert downey jr's final work in the mcu  fans wouldn't be blamed for assuming  tony stark might not survive to see  pepper potts again  tony was already a top choice for the  avengers infinity war kill list and it's  a good bet the stakes will be raised  even higher for avengers 4.  thanks to gwyneth paltrow's instagram  page however we know tony and pepper  will get to see each other at least one  more time  i'm sorry i'm sorry i don't know tony i  swear to god  here right now  in september 2018 while avengers 4 was  in the middle of reshoots paltrow posted  a photo of her and downey on set the  caption read simply lunchtime  accompanied by hashtag pepperoni a  mashup of pepper and tony  so we may not know whether pepper or  tony will survive avengers 4 but we do  know that their scene in infinity war  wasn't the last time the pair would see  each other  the good old days the same day gwyneth  paltrow posted her pepperoni shot on  instagram  chris evans posted a selfie on twitter  unveiling a relatively minor spoiler to  eagle-eyed fans  but one that could point to a much  larger reveal  in the photo evans infinity war facial  hair is gone and his hair more closely  resembles the look we've seen in earlier  films  the shot's caption reads senior year and  is followed by hashtag  a4 as thor correctly pointed out during  infinity war's battle of wakanda  the star-spangled avenger assumed a much  scruffier look in infinity war  okay notice you've copied my beard  now this photo could simply mean that by  the end of avengers 4 steve rogers will  decide he's not keen on beards anymore  however the idea that the avengers will  be bouncing around time  is one of the more heavily trafficked  theories about avengers 4.  evans could easily have been involved in  reshoots for a scene involving a captain  america from another era  in particular the photo gives credence  to a fan theory that was already growing  in popularity  that captain america will not die in  avengers 4 but will instead be sent back  in time to live the life with peggy  carter that his long sleep in the ice  stole from him  if true it could be a beautiful end to  the character's story

